  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/12/FIVOImproChaplim.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">(24 fotos) Chaplin Caf&egrave;, al carrer de Ros d&#39;Orsins, cant&oacute; Falcons d&#39;Onda, ha acollit aquest dijous un nou acte</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">, </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/12/FIVOImproChaplin2.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">a c&agrave;rrec d&#39;Arteatre, dins&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">del I Festival d&#39;Improvisaci&oacute; Vila d&#39;Onda, que acaba diumenge.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/improschaplindijous/img_9766.jpg\" alt=\"img_9766\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/improschaplindijous/img_9767.jpg\" alt=\"img_9767\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/improschaplindijous/img_9768.jpg\" alt=\"img_9768\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/improschaplindijous/img_9769.jpg\" alt=\"img_9769\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/improschaplindijous/img_9773.jpg\" alt=\"img_9773\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/improschaplindijous/img_9776.jpg\" alt=\"img_9776\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4